  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DFEF-Fighting gender based violence and reducing teenage pregnancy.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is located in Shiselweni region Swaziland, and its goal is to combat GBV (Gender Based Violence), and reduce dropout rates from school specifically because of teenage pregnancies through awareness raising activities, education and mitigation.</narrative>
  </description>
